title: "Resilient Logistics under Burst Disruptions: generator, dominance filter, and recorded result manifests"
abstract: >-
  Scenario generator, lossless dominance preprocessing, solver drivers, unit
  tests, and the recorded result manifests for every number reported in the
  accompanying IEEE Aerospace Conference paper on cislunar logistics design and
  worst-case verification under sustained transportation outages.
